  "decisions": [
    "Persist only the registered soldier.overwatch.bleed profile in this subsystem; do not create a generic Core Bleeding record or a general periodic-effect API.",
    "Supply the occurred Overwatch application from a finite fingerprinted test fixture; this schema does not execute designation, trigger, ranged attack, or rider choice.",
    "Resolve its one piercing d4 at the next target regular Start through the shared WorldSchedule, RNG, damage/life consequences, receipts, save/restore, and replay.",
    "Apply family arbitration before rolling; initial family immunity prevents application, while later immunity and suppression consume a due tick without damage. Losing records also consume their due tick.",
    "Medicine is a tactical Action by self or an adjacent helper using actual WIS and explicit Medicine training, and checks the recorded applying DC.",
    "Medicine uses shared adjusted task-degree resolution; the replay-audited event stores its natural result, modifier, DC, total, adjusted degree, outcome, and RNG provenance.",
    "A source-qualified positive-potential magical-healing event cures eligible records even if actual HP gain is zero.",
    "Different target timing markers resolve separately; same owner/source may therefore maintain independent records on distinct targets, each created only by its own lawful originating event.",
    "The synthetic pre-existing rider fixture exists only to test outside-encounter marker ordering and is not an Overwatch application event or runtime adapter.",
    "NEW provisional consensus completion: same-owner/source refresh preserves original record identity, applying DC, and arbitration order; the contemporary reapplication DC appears only in refresh audit history."
  ],
