  "limits": [
    "No Overwatch trigger, designation, weapon attack, target response, rider choice, Snare, Push, shared Bonus Action, automatic class grant, general periodic profile, or general condition engine.",
    "Ordinary condition-remover invocation is deferred until a concrete remover source supplies its prerequisites and exact one/all/owner scope; schema23 is not every registered cure path.",
    "All executable application, healing, and immunity facts are finite TEST_ONLY data; runtime production selection remains disabled.",
    "Medicine is tactical-only because the cited Action rule does not define an exploration treatment duration.",
    "Headless C# and static package checks do not establish Unity import, editor compilation, Edit Mode, Play Mode, player build, or gameplay qualification."
  ]
